# Tailwind and daisyUI

- Style with Tailwind utilities and daisyUI component classes. Do not add a `tailwind.config.js`.
- Shared entry is imported from each app `styles.css`:

```css
@import "tailwindcss";
@plugin "daisyui" {
  themes: light --default, dark --prefersdark;
}
```

- Prefer semantic daisyUI classes (`btn`, `btn-primary`, `card`, `navbar`, `input`) before long utility strings.
- Keep theme tokens in the `@plugin "daisyui"` block, not in TypeScript.
